  "description": "Introduced by Timurtype Studio!\nSweet Jenifer is a Handwritten Script Font \nThis font is a charming handwritten script font that blends graceful strokes with a sweet, elegant touch, perfect for adding a personal and romantic feel to logos, invitations, packaging, and creative designs.\nThese fonts include:\n– OTF\n– TTF\n– WOFF\nSweet Jenifer Font also supports multilingualism\nEnhance your designs with our original fonts, feel free to comment or provide feedback, Enjoy the fonts 😊\nThank You",
